items.summary_en:
It was a pleasure to meet Their Royal Highnesses The Prince and Princess of Wales.

Appreciate the Earthshot Prize’s efforts in championing innovative climate solutions worldwide and also showcasing Indian ingenuity in addressing global environmental challenges.

Look forward to further strengthening the India-UK Comprehensive Strategic Partnership and building on the momentum of the recently implemented Comprehensive Economic and Trade Agreement, for the shared prosperity of the people of our nations and the wider world.

@KensingtonRoyal 

@RoyalFamily

